# deep-plan: one row per phase. Format: id|title. The chain steps follow.
setup|Parse args, run folder and this step file (Phase 0)
codeintel|Code intelligence bootstrap (Phase 0.2)
ticket|Ticket and Slack context (Phase 0.3)
pipeline|Right pipeline check (Phase 0.4)
clarify|Clarifying questions (Phase 0.5)
grill|Grill-with-docs, unless --skip-grill (Phase 0.7)
brainstorm|Brainstorm (Phase 1)
draft|Two planners in parallel (Phase 1.5)
plan-review|Persona review loop, --max-plan-iter rounds at most (Phase 2)
qa-plan|/qa-plan, when a flow or a screen changes (Phase 2.4)
subplans|Subplan fan-out, when the plan is parallel (Phase 2.5)
gate|finalize-plan.sh and Plannotator gate (Phase 3)
executor|Execution recommendation (Phase 3.5)
@include chain.steps
